<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to Zyron</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #07090e;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #07090e;
      padding: 40px 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 580px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #0d1117;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }
    .header {
      padding: 24px 32px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(16, 24, 39, 0.8) 0%, rgba(13, 17, 23, 0.8) 100%);
    }
    .logo-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      background-color: rgba(0, 229, 191, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 191, 0.3);
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: #00e5bf;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      font-family: monospace;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 36px 32px;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    p {
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #94a3b8;
    }
    .accent {
      color: #00e5bf;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .info-card {
      background-color: #090d13;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .info-row {
      display: flex;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .info-row:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .info-label {
      color: #64748b;
      width: 140px;
    }
    .info-val {
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      background-color: #00e5bf;
      color: #07090e !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-top: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-family: monospace;
    }
    .footer {
      padding: 24px 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      background-color: #090d13;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #64748b;
      font-family: monospace;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <span class="logo-badge">ZYRON // PROTOCOL SECURITY</span>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <h1>Welcome to Zyron, <span class="accent">{{userName}}</span></h1>
        <p>Your security engagement workspace is ready. You now have full access to automated AST taint scanning, auditor workbenches, and cryptographic on-chain attestations.</p>
        
        {{#if orgName}}
        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">// PROTOCOL:</span>
            <span class="info-val">{{orgName}}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">// STATUS:</span>
            <span class="info-val" style="color: #00e5bf;">ACTIVE_ENGAGEMENT</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        <p>You can now submit smart contract audit scopes, monitor real-time vulnerability scan passes, and collaborate with lead auditors.</p>

        <div style="text-align: center; margin: 28px 0;">
          <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="btn">Launch Portal &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 0;">
          If you did not create this account, please contact our security team immediately at security@zyron.labs.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <div>ZYRON SECURITY PROTOCOL &bull; AUTONOMOUS SMART CONTRACT AUDIT</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 8px;">&copy; {{currentYear}} Zyron Protocol Labs. All rights reserved.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
